  nodeTextLayers:
  - title: 
    basic: The kink in GLP1-R's sixth helix creates a pocket for passing GProtein
      complexes to bind to.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: Upon binding with GLP1-R, the G Alpha subunit of GProtein releases a GDP
      molecule.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: GProtein binding with GLP1-R effectively completes a circuit transmitting
      the extracellular signal of GLP1 to the intracellular machinery of the pancreatic
      beta cell.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
